Looking at this problem, I need to:

1. Choose an optimal starting position T for the sound wave
2. Calculate when each icicle falls (fall_time = height + distance_from_T)
3. Find minimum time when Krakozyabra is entrapped (fallen icicles on both left and right sides)

Let me trace through the logic:
- Krakozyabra starts at position 1 (1-indexed) and moves right at 1 unit/sec, so at time t, Krakozyabra is at position t+1
- Actually looking at examples, it seems Krakozyabra is at position t at time t (0-indexed logic)
- An icicle at position i falls at time: a[i] + |position(i) - T|
- Entrapped when fallen_icicles_left < t < fallen_icicles_right

